      "voiceId": "michael-knowles",
      "voiceName": "Michael Knowles",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Thank you to the President, the First Lady, the White House staff, and of course the Easter Bunny for another excellent egg roll!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/michaeljknowles/status/2041277189673402709",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T22:09:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "michael-knowles",
      "voiceName": "Michael Knowles",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The President\u2019s discussing ongoing military strikes while flanked by the Easter Bunny is one of the most profoundly American images I\u2019ve ever seen.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/michaeljknowles/status/2041195587983286300",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-06T16:45:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "michael-knowles",
      "voiceName": "Michael Knowles",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I was also Catholic yesterday. But since so many people are posting this happy statement, I felt impelled to note that I\u2019m still Catholic today.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/michaeljknowles/status/2040928126520246359",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-05T23:02:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "michael-knowles",
      "voiceName": "Michael Knowles",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I am now Catholic.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/michaeljknowles/status/2040928123403833643",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-05T23:02:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "michael-knowles",
      "voiceName": "Michael Knowles",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A pleasure to sit down with @douglaswils! piped.video/JzRMVCUppZo?si=dQvH\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/michaeljknowles/status/2040593414824104340",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-05T00:52:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "michael-knowles",
      "voiceName": "Michael Knowles",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\u201cJust a reminder that a first-century Jew was actually Arab six centuries before Arabs conquered the Levant.\u201d \n\nUh\u2026\n\n\nMP Arizona\u2600\ufe0f\ud83c\udff3\ufe0f\u200d\ud83c\udf08\ud83d\udc99\ud83c\udf35\ud83d\udc15\ud83d\udc15\u200d\ud83e\uddba\ud83e\udec2\ud83d\udca6\ud83c\udfdc\ud83d\udc1f\ud83c\udf34\ud83c\udf99\ud83c\udf0e\ud83c\udf3b\u264d\ufe0f\ud83c\udf0a (@AzPetrich)\n\nJust a reminder for Christian's celebrating Easter this week. Jesus looked like the guy in the first picture - not the second.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/AzPetrich/status/2040446865133678901#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/michaeljknowles/status/2040580270970093826",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-05T00:00:23+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "michael-knowles",
      "voiceName": "Michael Knowles",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\udc4d\u271d\ufe0f\u271d\ufe0f\u271d\ufe0f\n\n\nJames A. Furey (@JamesAFurey)\n\nAfter 30 years of being an Atheist, tonight I will be baptized, confirmed, and reconciled to God. \n\nI cannot stop thinking about it.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/JamesAFurey/status/2040558096561414244#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/michaeljknowles/status/2040577917877366818",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-04T23:51:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "michael-knowles",
      "voiceName": "Michael Knowles",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is the best they\u2019ve got? The toughest attack they can lob at the Vice President is to criticize the (perfectly fine) cover the publisher chose for his new book? The libs are not sending their best!\n\n\nThe Washington Post (@washingtonpost)\n\nThe modest church on the cover of Vice President JD Vance\u2019s new memoir unpacking his Catholic faith has a tiny but loyal congregation.\n\nWhat it doesn\u2019t have, members said: any connection to Vance or Catholicism.\nwapo.st/4c3da9t\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/was",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/michaeljknowles/status/2040575939403231488",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-04T23:43:10+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "michael-knowles",
      "voiceName": "Michael Knowles",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\u201cProducers have not denied any of the below allegations but, when reached by Deadline for comment, said they \u2018don\u2019t negotiate with communists.\u2019\u201d deadline.com/2026/04/jonatha\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/michaeljknowles/status/2040503972159434784",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-04T18:57:12+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
